<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sophisticia | Handmade, made personal</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Explore thoughtfully crafted art, hand-painted clothing and resin keepsakes from Sophisticia.">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-sRIl4kxILFvY47J16cr9ZwB07vP4J8+LH7qKQnuqkuIAvNWLzeN8tE5YBujZqJLB" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="home-page">
<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg site-nav sticky-top">
  <div class="container">
    <a class="navbar-brand" href="/" aria-label="Sophisticia home">
      <img src="/image/Screenshot_2026-09-16_002159-removebg-preview.png" alt="" width="34" height="34">
      <span>Sophisticia</span>
    </a>
    <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNavigation" aria-controls="mainNavigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
      <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
    </button>
    <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNavigation">
      <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-lg-center">
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/shop">Shop</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/custom-order">Custom orders</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/cart">Cart</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item dropdown">
          <a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle" href="#" role="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">Account</a>
          <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end">
            <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/signup">Log In / Sign Up</a></li>
            <li><a class="dropdown-item" href="/logout">Log Out</a></li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <form class="nav-search ms-lg-4" role="search" action="/shop" method="get">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="homeSearch">Search products</label>
        <input class="form-control" type="search" id="homeSearch" name="search" placeholder="Find something lovely" aria-label="Search products">
        <button class="btn btn-search" type="submit" aria-label="Submit search">Search</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
        <div class="col-lg-6 hero-copy" data-reveal>
          <p class="eyebrow">Handmade from Pakistan</p>
          <h1>Art for the life <em>you make.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-description">Wearable art, thoughtful keepsakes and one-of-a-kind objects, made slowly and finished by hand.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/shop" class="btn btn-dark">Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
            <a href="/custom-order" class="text-link">Make it personal</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-note"><span class="hero-note-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Small-batch pieces, made with intention</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6" data-reveal>
          <div class="hero-image-frame">
            <div id="homeHeroCarousel" class="carousel slide" data-bs-ride="carousel" data-bs-interval="5000" data-bs-pause="hover">
              <div class="carousel-indicators" data-carousel-indicators></div>
              <div class="carousel-inner">
                <div class="carousel-item active">
                  <img src="/image/Impressive Designs.png" class="hero-image" alt="Handmade Sophisticia art and resin creations">
                </div>
                <div class="carousel-item">
                  <img src="/image/3.png" class="hero-image" alt="Hand-painted folk-art design on fabric">
                </div>
              </div>
              <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#homeHeroCarousel" data-bs-slide="prev" aria-label="Previous image">
                <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
              <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#homeHeroCarousel" data-bs-slide="next" aria-label="Next image">
                <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-image-label"><span>Painted by hand</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="craft-section py-5" id="crafts">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading d-flex flex-column flex-md-row justify-content-between align-items-md-end" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Find your kind of handmade</p>
          <h2>Made to be <em>kept.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/shop" class="text-link">Shop all creations <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4 craft-grid">
        <div class="col-md-4" data-reveal>
          <a class="craft-card" href="/shop">
            <img src="/image/This item is unavailable - Etsy.jfif" alt="A colorful handmade artwork">
            <span class="craft-card-copy"><span class="craft-number">01 / ART & OBJECTS</span><strong>Artworks</strong><span>Small details, lasting character</span></span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4" data-reveal>
          <a class="craft-card" href="/shop">
            <img src="/image/5.png" alt="Hand-painted shirt with original artwork">
            <span class="craft-card-copy"><span class="craft-number">02 / PAINTED WEAR</span><strong>Wearable art</strong><span>Everyday pieces, made expressive</span></span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4" data-reveal>
          <a class="craft-card" href="/shop">
            <img src="/image/4 inch beautiful car hangings 🫶🏻.jfif" alt="Handmade resin car hanging with dried flowers">
            <span class="craft-card-copy"><span class="craft-number">03 / RESIN CRAFTS</span><strong>Little keepsakes</strong><span>Color, texture and a personal touch</span></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="craft-cta"><a href="/custom-order" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Create a custom piece</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

    <section class="about-brand-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="about-image-wrap">
              <img src="/image/4.png" alt="Handmade product" class="img-fluid">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <p class="brand-kicker">About the Brand</p>
            <h2>Made by hand, made by heart.</h2>
            <p>
              Sophisticia brings together creativity, craftsmanship, and personal stories in every piece we make. Each design is carefully created by hand to celebrate individuality, warmth, and artistry.
            </p>
            <p>
              From hand-painted details to thoughtful gifting, our work is inspired by slow living, timeless beauty, and the joy of meaningful objects made with love.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="learn-more-wrap">
          <button class="learn-more-btn" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#brandMore" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="brandMore">
            Learn More
          </button>
          <div class="collapse" id="brandMore">
            <div class="learn-more-content">
              We believe handmade objects carry emotion, character, and a story behind every stroke. Our brand is built around thoughtful design, sustainable choices, and pieces that feel deeply personal. Whether it is custom work or a carefully selected item, each creation is made to be treasured, cherished, and passed on with meaning.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <h5>Sophisticia</h5>
            <p>
              Handmade creations made to celebrate beauty, individuality, and heartfelt craftsmanship.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-4">
            <h5>Quick Links</h5>
            <ul class="footer-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/shop">Shop</a></li>
                <li><a href="/custom-order">Custom Orders</a></li>
                <li><a href="/signup">Account</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-4">
            <h5>Get in Touch</h5>
            <ul class="footer-links">
              <li>Email: hello@sophisticia.com</li>
              <li>Phone: +92 300 1234567</li>
              <li>Location: Lahore, Pakistan</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-bottom">
          <p>© <span id="year"></span> Sophisticia. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="/js/home.js" defer></script>
